xes\">\\n      <item repeat=\"0-1\"> yes </item>\\n      <item repeat=\"0-1\"> okay </item>\\n      <item repeat=\"0-1\"> let's see </item>\\n      <one-of>\\n        <item> okay </item>\\n        <item> it's </item>\\n        <item> it is </item>\\n        <item> it would be </item>\\n        <item> that would be </item>\\n        <item> it was </item>\\n        <item> it will be </item>\\n        <item> it's going to be </item>\\n        <item> it's gonna be </item>\\n      </one-of>\\n    </rule>\\n \\n</grammar>\""
